OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple flights grounded amid
OL,4,A'connectivity issues'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of flights at Bristol Airport
OL,7,Fhave been delayed or cancelled due to a
OL,8,Ftechnical failure with air traffic
OL,9,Fcontrol systems.
OL,11,FA Bristol Airport spokesperson said the
OL,12,Fdisruption is being caused by a
OL,13,F"connectivity issue" at the National
OL,14,FAir Traffic Services (Nats) at
OL,15,FPrestwick Centre in Scotland.
OL,17,FBoth the arrival and departure boards
OL,18,Findicate delays of up to two hours,
OL,19,Falongside cancelled flights to
OL,20,Fdestinations including Barcelona, Nice
OL,21,Fand Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
