OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple flights grounded amid
OL,4,A'connectivity issues'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Nats confirmed the
OL,7,Fissue was now fixed and said it was
OL,8,Fworking with airports to lift air
OL,9,Ftraffic restrictions as soon as
OL,10,Fpossible.
